@startuml topology_iot
title IoT Smart Home - System Topology

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<device>> PaleGoldenrod
  BorderColor<<device>> #6B8E23
  BackgroundColor<<gateway>> LightBlue
  BorderColor<<gateway>> #2B6CB0
  BackgroundColor<<db>> LightYellow
  BorderColor<<db>> #C2A44B
}
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Client 1\n(User TUI)" as C1
actor "Client 2\n(User TUI)" as C2
actor "Client 3\n(User TUI)" as C3

cloud "IoT Dashboard\n(Java TUI / Controller)" as APP <<gateway>> #LightBlue

component "📺  TV\n(tv-1)\nRoom: LivingRoom\nStatus: OFF" as TV <<device>> #LightGray
component "❄  AC\n(ac-1)\nRoom: BedRoom1\nStatus: ON" as AC <<device>> #PaleGreen
component "🌀  Fan\n(fan-1)\nRoom: HallWay\nStatus: OFF" as FAN <<device>> #LightGray
component "🤖  RoboVac\n(rv-1)\nRoom: LivingRoom\nStatus: ON" as RV <<device>> #PaleGreen
component "💡  Light\n(light-1)\nRoom: Balcony\nStatus: OFF" as LIGHT <<device>> #LightGray

database "SQL Database\n(customers + gadgets)" as SQLDB <<db>> #LightYellow
database "Telemetry DB\n(time-series history - DynamoDB)" as TDB <<db>> #LightYellow

C1 --> APP : login / control
C2 --> APP : login / control
C3 --> APP : login / control

APP --> TV     : TCP / control
APP --> AC     : TCP / control
APP --> FAN    : TCP / control
APP --> RV     : TCP / control
APP --> LIGHT  : TCP / control

TV     -down-> TDB : telemetry (status events)
AC     -down-> TDB : telemetry (status events)
FAN    -down-> TDB : telemetry (status events)
RV     -down-> TDB : telemetry (status events)
LIGHT  -down-> TDB : telemetry (status events)

APP --> SQLDB : read / write (customers, gadgets, metadata)

@enduml